{"id":"pa1.u05","level":"PA1","order":5,"title":{"en":"Colors and things","ru":"Цвета и предметы"},"description":"Называем цвета, предметы вокруг и животных. Описываем: a red bag, a big white house. Спрашиваем: What is it? What color is it?","goals":["Могу назвать основные цвета и предметы вокруг.","Могу описать предмет: a big red bag.","Могу спросить и ответить: What is it? It is a bag. What color is it? It is blue.","Могу понять короткий диалог о предметах и их цвете.","Могу написать три коротких описания предметов."],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":["word-order","articles"],"texts":[{"id":"pa1.u05.what-color","kind":"dialogue","genre":"conversation","title":{"en":"What is it?","ru":"Что это?"},"speakers":[{"id":"anna","name":"Anna","voice":"female"},{"id":"tom","name":"Tom","voice":"male"}],"lines":[{"speaker":"anna","en":"What is it, Tom?","ru":"Что это, Том?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"It is a bag.","ru":"Это сумка."},{"speaker":"anna","en":"What color is it?","ru":"Какого она цвета?"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"It is blue and white.","ru":"Она синяя с белым."},{"speaker":"anna","en":"Thank you, Tom!","ru":"Спасибо, Том!"},{"speaker":"tom","en":"Bye, Anna!","ru":"Пока, Анна!"}],"glossary":[]},{"id":"pa1.u05.things","kind":"reading","genre":"article","title":{"en":"Things in a room","ru":"Вещи в комнате"},"speakers":[],"lines":[{"en":"A brown desk. A black computer. A small phone. A red pencil.","ru":"Коричневый письменный стол. Чёрный компьютер. Маленький телефон. Красный карандаш."},{"en":"A big white house. A green door. A pink flower. A grey bird.","ru":"Большой белый дом. Зелёная дверь. Розовый цветок. Серая птица."}],"glossary":[]}],"lessons":[{"id":"pa1.u05.l01","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Цвета","grammar":"pa1.adjectives","exercises":[{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e01","hint":"Цвет неба в ясный день.","explanation":"Blue — «синий». Ue на конце читается как долгое «у:»: [bluː].","difficulty":1,"words":["blue"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"blue","distractors":["green","red"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e02","hint":"Цвет ночи.","explanation":"Black — «чёрный». Ck на конце читается как «к».","difficulty":1,"words":["black"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"black","distractors":["white","brown"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e03","hint":"Цвет травы.","explanation":"Green — «зелёный». Ee читается как долгое «и:».","difficulty":1,"words":["green"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"green","distractors":["blue","yellow"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e04","hint":"Цвет снега.","explanation":"White — «белый». Начало слова — [w], как короткое «у».","difficulty":1,"words":["white"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"white","options":["белый","серый","чёрный"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e05","hint":"Слово начинается с br.","explanation":"Brown — «коричневый»: [braʊn]. Black — «чёрный», blue — «синий».","difficulty":1,"words":["blue","black","brown"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"коричневый","options":["brown","black","blue"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e06","hint":"Red и yellow вы уже знаете.","explanation":"Red — «красный», yellow — «жёлтый», pink — «розовый», grey — «серый», orange — «оранжевый» и «апельсин».","difficulty":1,"words":["pink","grey"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"red","ru":"красный"},{"en":"yellow","ru":"жёлтый"},{"en":"pink","ru":"розовый"},{"en":"grey","ru":"серый"},{"en":"orange","ru":"оранжевый"}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e07","hint":"В конце слышно «нк».","explanation":"Pink — «розовый»: [pɪŋk]. Буквы nk читаются как «нк» в нос.","difficulty":1,"words":["black","pink"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"pink","question":"Какое слово вы слышите?","options":["pink","pen","black"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e08","hint":"Слово заканчивается на «эй».","explanation":"Grey — «серый»: [ɡreɪ]. Green — «зелёный»: [ɡriːn].","difficulty":1,"words":["green","pink","grey"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"grey","question":"Какое слово вы слышите?","options":["grey","green","pink"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e09","hint":"О цвете спрашивают этим словом.","explanation":"What color is it? — «Какого это цвета?». Color — «цвет».","difficulty":1,"words":["color"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"What ___ is it?","translation":"Какого это цвета?","answers":[["color"]],"options":["color","name","number"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e10","hint":"Цвет снега.","explanation":"It is white — «он белый». Цвет называют после it is.","difficulty":1,"words":["black","white"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It is ___.","translation":"Он белый.","answers":[["white"]],"options":["white","black","red"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e11","hint":"Сначала a, потом цвет, потом предмет.","explanation":"A blue bag — «синяя сумка». Цвет стоит перед предметом.","difficulty":1,"words":["blue","black","bag"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Синяя сумка.","answer":"A blue bag.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["red","black"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e12","hint":"Три слова.","explanation":"A black car — «чёрная машина».","difficulty":1,"words":["black","car"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Чёрная машина.","answers":["A black car."]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l01.e13","hint":"Четыре цвета подряд.","explanation":"Произношение: red [red], blue [bluː], green [ɡriːn], yellow [ˈjeloʊ].","difficulty":1,"words":["blue","green"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"Red, blue, green, yellow."}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02","kind":"vocabulary","title":"Вещи и животные","exercises":[{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e01","hint":"По нему звонят.","explanation":"Phone — «телефон». Ph читается как [f]: [foʊn].","difficulty":1,"words":["phone"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"phone","distractors":["clock","computer"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e02","hint":"На ней ездят.","explanation":"Car — «машина». Букву r в американском английском читают: [kɑːr].","difficulty":1,"words":["car"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"word-to-picture","word":"car","distractors":["bus","bike"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e03","hint":"Это здание, где живут.","explanation":"House — «дом, здание». Home — тот дом, где человек живёт.","difficulty":1,"words":["house"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"house","distractors":["home","door"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e04","hint":"На ней ездят верхом.","explanation":"Horse — «лошадь»: [hɔːrs].","difficulty":1,"words":["horse"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"picture_choice","mode":"picture-to-word","word":"horse","distractors":["cow","duck"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e05","hint":"Pencil и ruler лежат в пенале.","explanation":"Bag — «сумка», door — «дверь», clock — «часы», pencil — «карандаш», ruler — «линейка».","difficulty":1,"words":["bag","door","clock","pencil","ruler"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"bag","ru":"сумка"},{"en":"door","ru":"дверь"},{"en":"clock","ru":"часы"},{"en":"pencil","ru":"карандаш"},{"en":"ruler","ru":"линейка"}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e06","hint":"Duck — тоже птица, но это отдельное слово.","explanation":"Bird — «птица», duck — «утка», cow — «корова», flower — «цветок», bottle — «бутылка».","difficulty":1,"words":["bottle","flower","bird","duck","cow"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"en":"bird","ru":"птица"},{"en":"duck","ru":"утка"},{"en":"cow","ru":"корова"},{"en":"flower","ru":"цветок"},{"en":"bottle","ru":"бутылка"}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e07","hint":"Слово похоже на русское.","explanation":"Computer — «компьютер». Ударение на втором слоге: com-PU-ter.","difficulty":1,"words":["computer"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"computer","options":["компьютер","телефон","стол"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e08","hint":"Слово начинается с d и заканчивается на k.","explanation":"Desk — «письменный стол, парта». Table — другой стол, обеденный.","difficulty":1,"words":["door","desk","duck"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"ru","text":"письменный стол","options":["desk","door","duck"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e09","hint":"Слышно «кау».","explanation":"Cow — «корова»: [kaʊ]. Car — «машина», cup — «чашка».","difficulty":1,"words":["car","cow"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"cow","question":"Какое слово вы слышите?","options":["cow","car","cup"],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e10","hint":"Четыре буквы.","explanation":"Bird — «птица»: [bɝːd]. Ir читается как долгое «ё:».","difficulty":1,"words":["bird"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"bird","answers":[]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e11","hint":"Четыре буквы, две из них — o.","explanation":"Door — «дверь»: [dɔːr].","difficulty":1,"words":["door"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"дверь","answers":["door"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e12","hint":"Для предмета и животного — it.","explanation":"It is a cat — «это кошка». Для животных и вещей используется it.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Это кошка.","answer":"It is a cat.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["am","dog"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e13","hint":"Нужно название животного, не цвет и не размер.","explanation":"It is a horse. После a стоит предмет или животное.","difficulty":1,"words":["blue","small","horse"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"What is it? — It is a ___.","translation":"Что это? — Это лошадь.","answers":[["horse"]],"options":["horse","blue","small"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l02.e14","hint":"Вопрос идёт вниз, ответ ровно.","explanation":"What is it? — голос идёт вниз. It is a bird — ударение на bird.","difficulty":1,"words":["bird"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"What is it? It is a bird."}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03","kind":"grammar","title":"Какой? Какого цвета?","grammar":"pa1.adjectives","exercises":[{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e01","hint":"Описание стоит перед предметом.","explanation":"A red bag. Прилагательное идёт перед существительным.","difficulty":1,"words":["bag"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"A bag red.","wrong":"bag red","correction":"red bag","options":["red bag","bag a red","reds bag"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e02","hint":"Сначала размер, потом цвет.","explanation":"A big red bag. Размер идёт перед цветом.","difficulty":1,"words":["bag"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":["word-order"],"type":"error_correction","text":"A red big bag.","wrong":"red big","correction":"big red","options":["big red","red a big","big a red"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e03","hint":"Размер идёт первым.","explanation":"A big red car — размер big стоит перед цветом red.","difficulty":1,"words":["pink","grey","car"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"A ___ red car.","translation":"Большая красная машина.","answers":[["big"]],"options":["big","pink","grey"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e04","hint":"It — один предмет.","explanation":"What color is it? С it — is.","difficulty":1,"words":["color"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives","pa1.i-am"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"What color ___ it?","translation":"Какого это цвета?","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","am","are"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e05","hint":"С it — is.","explanation":"It is a brown desk. С it всегда is.","difficulty":1,"words":["brown","desk"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives","pa1.i-am"],"troubles":[],"type":"fill_gap","text":"It ___ a brown desk.","translation":"Это коричневый письменный стол.","answers":[["is"]],"options":["is","am","are"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e06","hint":"Размер, потом цвет.","explanation":"A small blue phone: размер small стоит перед цветом blue.","difficulty":2,"words":["blue","small","phone"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Маленький синий телефон.","answer":"A small blue phone.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["big","red"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e07","hint":"Сначала размер.","explanation":"A big white house — «большой белый дом».","difficulty":2,"words":["white","grey","small","house"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"tiles","from":"ru","text":"Большой белый дом.","answer":"A big white house.","alternatives":[],"distractors":["small","grey"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e08","hint":"Три слова.","explanation":"What is it? — «Что это?». Для предмета — it.","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Что это?","answers":["What is it?","What's it?"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e09","hint":"Color — «цвет».","explanation":"What color is it? — «Какого это цвета?».","difficulty":1,"words":["color"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"type_translation","from":"ru","text":"Какого это цвета?","answers":["What color is it?"]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e10","hint":"Small — маленький, grey — серый.","explanation":"It is a small grey bird — «это маленькая серая птица».","difficulty":1,"words":["grey","small","bird"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"translate_choice","from":"en","text":"It is a small grey bird.","options":["Это маленькая серая птица.","Это большая серая птица.","Это маленькая белая птица."],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e11","hint":"В одном слове слышно «ч».","explanation":"Chip начинается с [tʃ] — «ч», ship — с [ʃ] — «ш».","difficulty":1,"words":[],"grammar":[],"troubles":["pron-vowels"],"type":"minimal_pair","pair":[{"en":"ship","ipa":"ʃɪp"},{"en":"chip","ipa":"tʃɪp"}],"say":1},{"id":"pa1.u05.l03.e12","hint":"Три слова подряд, ровно.","explanation":"A big red car: размер, цвет, предмет. Произносится слитно.","difficulty":1,"words":["car"],"grammar":["pa1.adjectives"],"troubles":[],"type":"speak_repeat","text":"A big red car."}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l04","kind":"listening","title":"Что это?","textId":"pa1.u05.what-color","exercises":[{"id":"pa1.u05.l04.e01","hint":"Анна спрашивает, что это и какого цвета.","explanation":"Анна спрашивает про вещь Тома: это сумка, синяя с белым.","difficulty":1,"words":["blue","green","black","white","small","bag","phone","car"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"comprehension","mode":"listening","textId":"pa1.u05.what-color","questions":[{"kind":"mcq","question":"Что это?","options":["a bag","a phone","a car"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Том говорит: It is a bag."},{"kind":"mcq","question":"Какого она цвета?","options":["blue and white","black","red and green"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Том говорит: It is blue and white."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"It is a bag.","answer":"true","explanation":"Том говорит: It is a bag."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"It is black.","answer":"false","explanation":"Она синяя с белым, а не чёрная."},{"kind":"tfn","statement":"It is small.","answer":"not_given","explanation":"О размере сумки в диалоге ничего не сказано."}]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l04.e02","hint":"Цвет — синий, предмет — сумка.","explanation":"It is a blue bag — «это синяя сумка».","difficulty":1,"words":["blue","black","bag"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_choice","audio":"It is a blue bag.","question":"Что вы слышите?","options":["It is a blue bag.","It is a black bag.","It is a blue bus."],"answer":0},{"id":"pa1.u05.l04.e03","hint":"Четыре слова.","explanation":"What color is it? — «Какого это цвета?».","difficulty":1,"words":["color"],"grammar":[],"troubles":[],"type":"listen_dictation","text":"What color is it?","answers":[]},{"id":"pa1.u05.l04.e04","hint":"Пять слов.","explanation":"It is a small car — «это маленькая машина».","difficulty":1,"words":["sma